  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overarching goal of the project is to support the Government of Cura&#xe7;ao in updating its National Development Plan, with a focus on improving SDG data availability and positioning Cura&#xe7;ao as a regional leader in SDG achievement by 2030.Specific objectives include:-	Identifying national priorities and key indicators to achieve those priorities.-	Working with national institutions to improve data collection and availability for SDG indicators prioritized in the National Development Plan.-	Enhan</narrative>
